ull,"104900877968218270089"]]],[[[2],[[null,null,null,null,1]]]],[2,null,null,null,null,[null,null,null,[7,3]],null,null,[2026,6,22,14,null,null,null,null,["2 個月前"]]],["//www.google.com/local/imagery/report/?cb_client\u003dmaps_sv.tactile\u0026image_key\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhBQQbN4v4Q1U5w10JXSjQ9W\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0x10c98e45c03aec63"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["0","1209654405154663523"],null,null,[null,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnMVQzWlZMVFEyT1hWc1RHbHRVVjkwUmpKUUxWRRAB"]],"CIABIhBQQbN4v4Q1U5w10JXSjQ9W",1]],null,null,null,[[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"用餐類型為何？",[[[["E:DINNER"],"晚餐",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3YcHCEcoAA"]],1],null,null,"餐點類型",null,"0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3IcHCEYoBQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3YcHCEkoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3IcHCEgoBg",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3YcHCEsoAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3IcHCEooBw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_10_TO_30_MIN"],"10 到 30 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3YcHCE0oAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwic9f-m6NGWAxUDZ_UHHSpPK5oQ3IcHCEwoCA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這間拉麵店在新莊幸福路、JC PARK商圈附近算是相當有名的拉麵店，每次經過幾乎都看到門口有人排隊。我自己已經來過兩、三次，每次都看到候位人潮超過30分鐘的牌子，這次終於又找時間來吃。\n\n店家門口會很貼心地標示目前候位時間，讓客人可以自行評估是否等待。這次原本看到牌子寫大約要等半小時，不過實際上大概十多分鐘就入座了，算是比預期快不少。\n\n這次點的是醬油湯頭拉麵，湯頭濃郁但不死鹹，喝得出層次感；叉燒肉份量充足，口感軟嫩，肉量給得相當有誠意。麵條本身也很有水準，搭配湯頭一起入口相當順口。\n\n最讓我意外的是加麵的份量，非常大方，幾乎接近一般陽春麵一碗半的份量，食量稍大的人也能吃得非常滿足。\n\n店內環境維持得不錯，冷氣也很夠力，即使夏天用餐也相當舒服。現場也看到不少人專程來拍照打卡，甚至有人帶著單眼相機記錄餐點，可見這間店在新莊已經累積不少人氣與口碑。\n\n以310元的價格來說，如果單純看餐點品質、用料、份量與環境，我認為是值得給五星的。\n\n不過考量到位處新莊而非台北市中心，加上熱門時段仍需花一些時間排隊候位，整體便利性稍微打了折扣，因此個人給予四顆星評價。\n\n但如果是喜歡日式拉麵的人，來到新莊幸福路一帶，這間店仍然是相當值得一試的拉麵名店。",null,[0,92]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuTVZReldsWk1WRkV5VDFoV2MxUkhiSFJWVmprd1VtcEtVVXhXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuTVZReldsWk1WRkV5VDFoV2MxUkhiSFJWVmprd1VtcEtVVXhXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuTVZReldsWk1WRkV5VDFoV2MxUkhiSFJWVmprd1VtcEtVVXhXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuTVZReldsWk1WRkV5VDFoV2MxUkhiSFJWVmprd1VtcEtVVXhXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuTVZReldsWk1WRkV5VDFoV2MxUkhiSFJWVmprd1VtcEtVVXhXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuTVZReldsWk1WRkV5VDFoV2MxUkhiSFJWVmprd1VtcEtVVXhXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,22756,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnMVQzWlZMVFEyT1hWc1RHbHRVVjkwUmpKUUxWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x10c98e45c03aec63!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkg1T3ZVLTQ2OXVsTGltUV90RjJQLVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnMVQzWlZMVFEyT1hWc1RHbHRVVjkwUmpKUUxWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnMVQzWlZMVFEyT1hWc1RHbHRVVjkwUmpKUUxWRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnMVQzWlZMVFEyT1hWc1RHbHRVVjkwUmpKUUxWRRILMGVESko1M2c2NWkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rZzFUM1pWTFRRMk9YVnNUR2x